# Copy this file to secrets/mcp_http_bearer_token and replace the value
# below with a real random secret before starting docker-compose.router.yml.
# Generate one with:
#   openssl rand -hex 32 > secrets/mcp_http_bearer_token
#
# The file's *entire contents* (minus a single trailing newline) become the
# MCP_HTTP_BEARER_TOKEN value that streamable-HTTP clients must send as
# `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Do not put more than one line in this
# file. Never commit the real secrets/mcp_http_bearer_token file.
REPLACE_WITH_A_LONG_RANDOM_VALUE_never_commit_the_real_file
